  "content": "<h1>寧靜季節 - Pam's HarvestCraft 2: Crops 相容</h1><p>讓作物在各自對應的季節中生長！</p><h2>📖 關於</h2><p>本模組使<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" rel=\"nofollow\">寧靜季節</a>的季節性肥沃度系統，能與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's HarvestCraft 2: Crops</a>中的所有作物相容。</p><h2>🌳 與樹木的相容性？</h2><p>請查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons-pams-harvestcraft-2-trees-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">寧靜季節 - Pam's HarvestCraft 2: Trees 相容</a>！</p><h2>📗 重要事項</h2><p>請始終使用與您遊玩的Minecraft版本相對應的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" rel=\"nofollow\">寧靜季節</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's HarvestCraft 2: Crops</a>最新可用版本！</p>",
